0..82 Comment "//! The folds over a list of naturals — its length, appending and mapping — in"
83..159 Comment "//! the spellings an arm admits, each as the sugared form writes it: a `run`"
160..238 Comment "//! that only sequences a call, its result returned or the `return` elided, is"
239..318 Comment "//! written with the call nested in the constructor, and a `run` written inside"
319..394 Comment "//! a constructor\'s field stays. Each spelling of one fold runs to the same"
395..473 Comment "//! value, and the polymorphic length of `recursive-lists.gandr` checks at the"
474..554 Comment "//! naturals. A structural recursive call stands one stage below the list it was"
555..613 Comment "//! read from [Abel-2004-termination_checking_with_types]."
614..617 Comment "//!"
618..674 Comment "//! - cites: [Abel-2004-termination_checking_with_types]"
675..678 Comment "//!"
679..803 Comment "//! [Abel-2004-termination_checking_with_types]: https://doi.org/10.1051/ita:2004015 \"Abel, Termination checking with types\""
